1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:00,320
= kisskh.lv =

2
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,530
♪ From primal chaos to the starry sky ♪

3
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪ In the whole world, we shall hold the balance ♪

4
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,916
♪ The cauldron tempers divine blades ♪

5
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪ The furnace refines the empty void ♪

6
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,906
♪ The Way is in mystic fate ♪

7
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪ Be brave enough to split the primal chaos wide open ♪

8
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,596
[Pull Strings]

9
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,500
[Adapted from the novel by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

10
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,850
Qi Yuan,

11
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,380
watching you tormented

12
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:47,540
by love sickness day after day

13
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:51,130
just warms my heart.

14
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:04,020
Resentment

15
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:08,450
is the world's best weapon.

16
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,610
This is a drop of Bear Islanders' blood.

17
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,540
Only Bear Islanders' blood

18
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:19,170
can awaken the Pregenesis Sword.

19
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:21,166
I want you to use a spell formation

20
00:02:21,190 --> 00:02:22,340
to control someone

21
00:02:23,190 --> 00:02:24,570
and borrow his strength

22
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:28,536
to turn Bear Islanders' blood to mist.

23
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,850
This jade talisman

24
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,820
was left by Senior Wan.

25
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:39,130
When the blood mist touches the Pregenesis Sword,

26
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:43,690
it'll absorb everyone's power.

27
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:54,380
[Episode 20]

28
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:58,570
You knew the rumors were about you,

29
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,380
so you hid in Ascendance Sect.

30
00:03:01,710 --> 00:03:04,220
You also knew we were after the Pregenesis Sword,

31
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,820
so this sword

32
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,610
must be hidden on you.

33
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,570
You were careful.

34
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,820
Every move was flawless.

35
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,680
But

36
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:20,730
that was your biggest weak spot.

37
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,610
Were we a step too late?

38
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:42,610
My magical power is fading.

39
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:43,750
This feeling

40
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,640
is just like when we were at Bear Island.

41
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:51,380
[Hall of Mortal Coils]

42
00:04:03,710 --> 00:04:04,710
Senior.

43
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,080
Why is

44
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,780
my power fading?

45
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,780
Everyone, hold the line!

46
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,050
Wipe out Ascendance Sect!

47
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,360
Charge!

48
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:33,536
Demon Army,

49
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:35,016
surround the Hall of Mortal Coils!

50
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,290
Let no one escape!

51
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,560
That's...

52
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,810
Senior,

53
00:04:59,870 --> 00:05:02,046
my power is truly gone!

54
00:05:02,070 --> 00:05:03,070
What do we do?

55
00:05:15,390 --> 00:05:16,930
Monster! Get away!

56
00:05:17,070 --> 00:05:18,070
Get away!

57
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:19,730
Please?

58
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,700
Get away! Get away!

59
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,540
Xuanya,

60
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:27,540
you are of noble birth.

61
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,000
If you can,

62
00:05:29,630 --> 00:05:30,630
escape.

63
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:32,290
I'm a disciple of Ascendance Sect.

64
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:35,780
I stand with the sect.

65
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,020
Mentor, I'm out of spiritual power.

66
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,680
This...

67
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,046
Their spiritual power is gone.

68
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:49,070
He...

69
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,240
What to do?

70
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,720
Senior!

71
00:05:53,870 --> 00:05:54,870
Senior!

72
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:56,310
Senior!

73
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,020
All fellow disciples,

74
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,430
draw your swords!

75
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,100
Even if we die today,

76
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:06,580
we must defend our sect to the last.

77
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:08,050
Defend our sect to the last!

78
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,576
Senior!

79
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,730
Senior, please wake up.

80
00:06:19,430 --> 00:06:19,850
Senior!

81
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,490
Senior, wake up. Please.

82
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,696
Senior, look at me.

83
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,720
Wake up.

84
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:26,830
Senior.

85
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:28,950
Senior.

86
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,730
Senior! Senior!

87
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:40,660
This foolish old man...

88
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,080
It's Bear Islanders' blood.

89
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,120
My mentor was made the formation core.

90
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,170
Bear Islanders' blood woke up the Sword.

91
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,700
I miscalculated.

92
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:50,606
Little rascal, you

93
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:52,900
I never saw the formation would drive the Sword.

94
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:53,950
That was my oversight.

95
00:06:54,430 --> 00:06:55,406
This foolish old man

96
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:58,020
hid the truth about Kuai Si from me.

97
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,166
But now, I've found the core,

98
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:02,540
so I can break the formation.

99
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:04,370
Just give me more time.

100
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:07,190
Little rascal.

101
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:08,830
Li Changshou.

102
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:13,390
Right now,

103
00:07:13,830 --> 00:07:15,150
you don't have to be so rational.

104
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:17,020
It's okay to cry.

105
00:07:18,510 --> 00:07:19,100
You're human,

106
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:20,190
not a deity.

107
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:21,830
No need to control everything.

108
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,680
Don't be afraid.

109
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,406
I'm heading to Ascendance Sect right now.

110
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:27,656
When I arrive, everything will be fine.

111
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,246
You mustn't!

112
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:29,410
I ride the clouds.

113
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:31,606
I'll be there in half a stick of incense's time.

114
00:07:31,630 --> 00:07:32,366
Wait for me.

115
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:33,220
Yunxiao, don't!

116
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,360
Why?

117
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,220
You're clearly at your wit's end.

118
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:39,780
I have plenty of strategies.

119
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,606
How could I be at my wit's end?

120
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:42,630
Don't worry.

121
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:49,900
You taught me to trust others.

122
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,660
Don't you trust me?

123
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,800
You are

124
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:56,220
my last resort.

125
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:57,870
You must not be exposed.

126
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:02,460
Even if Seizing members are being killed,

127
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:04,750
I still can't help them?

128
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,140
You've been lying to me.

129
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,810
But I trusted you all this time.

130
00:08:12,190 --> 00:08:13,340
You said you had a plan.

131
00:08:13,630 --> 00:08:14,606
What plan?

132
00:08:14,630 --> 00:08:16,220
Can it save my Seizing fellows?

133
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,800
Let me hear it.

134
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,240
I'm sorry, Yunxiao.

135
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,170
I thought.

136
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,216
I could solve all of this,

137
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,606
repel the Demon Clan

138
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:32,980
and restore Seizing cultivators.

139
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:34,940
I thought I could save everyone.

140
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,150
I'm sorry.

141
00:08:39,790 --> 00:08:41,610
If you'd listened to me from the start,

142
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,400
taken the fight to Westdawn Sect,

143
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,130
and even killed Kuai Si first,

144
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,240
things

145
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,850
wouldn't have come to this.

146
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,300
You're always scheming,

147
00:08:52,750 --> 00:08:54,220
yet you keep losing more.

148
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:56,610
Why is the Great Tribulation drawing near?

149
00:08:59,150 --> 00:09:00,550
I'm heading to Ascendance Sect now.

150
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:01,670
Yunxiao, you mustn't.

151
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:02,726
Why?

152
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:04,006
Because two pieces of the Sword

153
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:05,770
cannot be in the same place at once.

154
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:14,180
We only split the Sword fragment into three pieces

155
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,766
to ensure

156
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:17,490
no one could get this key

157
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:19,310
and avert the Great Tribulation.

158
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:37,030
So,

159
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:40,980
from the moment I got this Sword fragment,

160
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,610
you had already decided

161
00:09:45,630 --> 00:09:47,060
never to see me again?

162
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,730
It's not my decision.

163
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:52,816
It's fate.

164
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,460
But I have never believed in fate.

165
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:58,150
Yunxiao,

166
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,700
please, think calmly.

167
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,610
You've been under Westdawn Sect's control.

168
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:05,300
Did you think they wouldn't anticipate you?

169
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,940
This is a trap.

170
00:10:08,630 --> 00:10:09,630
If you come,

171
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:12,216
you'll simply become a puppet like my mentor.

172
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,606
What we must do now

173
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:14,526
isn't how to rescue

174
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:16,296
those controlled by the Demon Clan,

175
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,816
but how to clear Seizing Sect's name

176
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,180
and restore their innocence.

177
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,730
Yunxiao, please think again.

178
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,080
Alright.

179
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,770
Even now,

180
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,820
you're still thinking of me.

181
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,820
What a selfless hero.

182
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,460
This time, I'll do as you say.

183
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,370
I won't come find you.

184
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,580
But after today, we needn't stay in touch.

185
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,010
I'll follow my own heart from now on.

186
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:56,060
I won't consult you on every matter.

187
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:58,630
Farewell,

188
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,480
Li Changshou.

189
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:15,250
♪ See mortal joys and sorrows ♪

190
00:11:17,130 --> 00:11:23,620
♪ Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds ♪

191
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:31,140
♪ Alas, love has many twists and turns ♪

192
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:39,020
♪ Memories filled with sorrow ♪

193
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:42,100
I'm sorry, Senior.

194
00:11:46,150 --> 00:11:48,010
Senior, you're finally back.

195
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:49,976
Why can't we use our magical power?

196
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,250
But those demons can.

197
00:11:51,670 --> 00:11:52,846
Because they are from the Demon Clan.

198
00:11:52,870 --> 00:11:53,976
They're immune to the Pregenesis Sword.

199
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,700
What sword?

200
00:11:54,750 --> 00:11:56,060
I must leave here at once.

201
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:58,250
You're trying to flee now?

202
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,460
They weaken as they get close to me.

203
00:12:01,670 --> 00:12:02,670
Come with me.

204
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,200
Only when the Three Sects join forces

205
00:12:05,910 --> 00:12:07,340
can there be hope.

206
00:12:11,030 --> 00:12:12,610
The Three Sects have to join forces.

207
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:17,300
The Three Sects have to join forces.

208
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,160
The Three Sects have to join forces?

209
00:12:20,750 --> 00:12:23,010
With Ascendance Sect alone,

210
00:12:23,910 --> 00:12:25,890
we can't weather this trial.

211
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,080
Jiu Wu.

212
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,200
Jiu Jiu.

213
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:32,340
Save Ascendance Sect.

214
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,460
I'm Jiu Wu

215
00:12:40,030 --> 00:12:41,030
at your command.

216
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:46,650
I'm Jiu Jiu

217
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,200
at your command.

218
00:13:09,030 --> 00:13:11,220
Fairy Yunxiao, a gifted Seizing disciple.

219
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,416
Why barge into Celestial Court?

220
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,440
Looking for someone.

221
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:16,670
Looking for someone?

222
00:13:17,150 --> 00:13:18,846
The Celestial Court has its rules.

223
00:13:18,870 --> 00:13:21,490
You can't come and go as you please.

224
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,840
Is that so?

225
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,080
Come in.

226
00:13:47,030 --> 00:13:49,696
Da, Er, I'm starving.

227
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,010
I want some mutton soup.

228
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:53,816
Hurry, hurry!

229
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:54,840
Come out, come out!

230
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:58,770
Are you that great deity?

231
00:13:59,910 --> 00:14:00,910
No.

232
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:01,980
I'm also from the Sea Deity Sect.

233
00:14:02,030 --> 00:14:03,650
How come I don't recognize you?

234
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,726
Ke Le'er!

235
00:14:13,750 --> 00:14:14,766
That's me.

236
00:14:14,790 --> 00:14:15,336
Quick, quick!

237
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:16,360
What?

238
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,600
Don't ask.

239
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:19,420
Come out. Come out now!

240
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:30,870
Ke Le'er.

241
00:14:31,750 --> 00:14:32,750
Ke Le'er.

242
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:34,980
So good to see you.

243
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,056
Ke Le'er.

244
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:38,010
Ke Le'er, Ke Le'er.

245
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,126
Ke Le'er.

246
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:39,650
You all...

247
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:42,100
You can leave?

248
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,480
Right.

249
00:14:43,750 --> 00:14:45,576
Then why are you still here?

250
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,176
No one told us to leave.

251
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,096
Yes.

252
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:48,416
Exactly.

253
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,650
Can we go?

254
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,010
Of course.

255
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,770
You still need to save your people.

256
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:54,370
Right, go quickly.

257
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,480
Go, go.

258
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:56,750
Hurry, go, go.

259
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,320
Go now.

260
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:01,296
Finally, they're gone. Let's go too.

261
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,320
Wait.

262
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,480
We can't take her.

263
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,840
Why?

264
00:15:05,030 --> 00:15:06,270
You belong to the Seizing Sect.

265
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:07,520
It's dangerous to take you.

266
00:15:09,030 --> 00:15:10,030
You suspect me?

267
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,176
No.

268
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,200
Then what do you mean?

269
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:15,130
Breaking through means a death battle.

270
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:16,820
When you see your mentor,

271
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,420
could you strike him?

272
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:22,060
If she can't do it,

273
00:15:22,870 --> 00:15:23,980
then she's a liability.

274
00:15:24,150 --> 00:15:25,150
Then...

275
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,240
In that case,

276
00:15:27,270 --> 00:15:29,010
I won't go with you.

277
00:15:29,510 --> 00:15:30,510
Your Highness,

278
00:15:30,670 --> 00:15:32,220
the Pearl Elites are well-trained.

279
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:34,220
Even without magical power, they can fight.

280
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,610
She's from the Seizing Sect.

281
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,340
Without magical power, she's useless.

282
00:15:38,150 --> 00:15:39,650
The Pearl Elites can guard you.

283
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:41,730
They are your safest choice.

284
00:15:42,030 --> 00:15:43,486
I know that, Si'er.

285
00:15:43,510 --> 00:15:45,250
Thank you for saving me.

286
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:46,440
But.

287
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,580
I want to protect my senior.

288
00:15:50,630 --> 00:15:51,630
If that is your wish,

289
00:15:51,910 --> 00:15:54,056
then may you shine,

290
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,080
break through the siege,

291
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,130
and survive this trial.

292
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,730
We shall meet again.

293
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,220
Let us go too, Senior.

294
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,440
Wait.

295
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,610
Where is Cansheng?

296
00:16:15,510 --> 00:16:16,510
Cansheng...

297
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,490
Why so many mosquitoes?

298
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:27,840
Da, Er.

299
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,010
Go, now!

300
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,320
Hurry!

301
00:16:34,940 --> 00:16:38,246
[Subtle and Mystic]

302
00:16:38,270 --> 00:16:39,270
Guard all exits.

303
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:40,440
Let no one escape.

304
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:43,530
The Pregenesis Sword must be here.

305
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:50,770
Changgeng.

306
00:17:01,030 --> 00:17:02,530
How's that? Not bad, right?

307
00:17:07,830 --> 00:17:09,326
I made such a big sacrifice this time.

308
00:17:09,350 --> 00:17:10,940
Senior must be very moved.

309
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,240
Zhao Gongming.

310
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:16,640
Zhao Gongming.

311
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:18,750
Zhao Gongming.

312
00:17:20,030 --> 00:17:21,180
Zhao Gongming, come out!

313
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:24,720
Zhao.

314
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:34,046
I've never seen a temple like yours

315
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:35,900
in Jade Division.

316
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:38,416
No, just say what you want to say.

317
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,460
Don't touch my money!

318
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,720
Come out and help them.

319
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:44,770
I'm scared.

320
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:47,330
My power's faded. I can't win.

321
00:17:47,590 --> 00:17:49,220
Then how did you transform?

322
00:17:49,550 --> 00:17:50,566
My power worked when I transformed.

323
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:51,216
Now, I lack the power

324
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,856
to change back.

325
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,086
I

326
00:17:53,110 --> 00:17:53,896
5,000 spirit stones.

327
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:54,920
Go.

328
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,160
Hurry!

329
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:23,250
Cansheng, what's wrong?

330
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:24,640
Cansheng.

331
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:38,350
Cansheng.

332
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,640
Go.

333
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:54,086
Why should I be curious?

334
00:18:54,110 --> 00:18:54,696
Likewise.

335
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:55,530
I'm done talking to you.

336
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,566
You're a bad man.

337
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:57,896
I'll go back to the sect and report you.

338
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,376
Changshou.

339
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,806
Senior Yuan Qing scolds sweetly.

340
00:19:01,830 --> 00:19:02,976
It's okay if you move.

341
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,010
It's already late.

342
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:05,376
I don't care.

343
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,250
Li Changshou!

344
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,220
I must go save Cansheng.

345
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:20,250
Cansheng's body is special; Don't worry.

346
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:22,616
Mentor has vanished.

347
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:23,840
I can't leave Cansheng behind.

348
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,240
Little Uncle,

349
00:19:25,350 --> 00:19:26,726
I treat you like my own brother.

350
00:19:26,750 --> 00:19:28,286
Then Cansheng is my brother too.

351
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:29,570
I can't just leave him behind.

352
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,006
I must keep him safe,

353
00:19:31,030 --> 00:19:32,420
just as I must keep you safe.

354
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:35,090
Little Uncle, you go first.

355
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,770
Then I'll bring Cansheng to you.

356
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:39,010
Thanks for saying you'd protect me.

357
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:42,460
But I'm Mentor Yuan Ze's first disciple.

358
00:19:44,350 --> 00:19:45,490
He's vanished.

359
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:48,860
Only I can hold Turtle Island.

360
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:53,216
♪ At the cloud peak, with sun and moon ♪

361
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:55,356
I'll bring Cansheng back to see you.

362
00:19:55,380 --> 00:19:58,410
♪ My heart is carved with all living beings ♪

363
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:04,860
♪ An unexpected meeting in this Primordial World ♪

364
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:11,460
♪ This lad, at first, is hard to admire ♪

365
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:16,310
♪ In a flash, I recall our near misses ♪

366
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:23,960
♪ Fearing inescapable karmic threads ♪

367
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,290
Little Uncle,

368
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,530
I hope I can see you again.

369
00:20:29,980 --> 00:20:34,810
♪ An edge hides, yet flows with ease ♪

370
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:40,616
♪ Making me lean down and confirm slowly ♪

371
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:42,660
Cansheng, I'm coming to save you.

372
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:51,310
Senior!

373
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:12,530
Senior,

374
00:21:13,750 --> 00:21:15,180
I will protect you.

375
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:26,006
Senior,

376
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:27,490
I will save you!

377
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:53,700
The Second Prince.

378
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,440
This...

379
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:14,640
How

380
00:22:16,030 --> 00:22:17,420
can there be a dragon?

381
00:22:23,030 --> 00:22:24,030
Little Uncle.

382
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:26,790
Little Uncle.

383
00:22:30,750 --> 00:22:31,940
Little Uncle's clothes.

384
00:22:38,510 --> 00:22:39,660
Who let you in?

385
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:40,766
This is Turtle Island.

386
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:41,940
I go where I please.

387
00:22:45,270 --> 00:22:47,230
There are plenty of pitiful people in this world.

388
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:50,176
If all wallowed in self-pity like you,

389
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,660
they would have died long ago.

390
00:22:56,310 --> 00:22:57,806
You are now one of Turtle Island.

391
00:22:57,830 --> 00:22:59,330
If anyone outside dares to bully you,

392
00:22:59,510 --> 00:23:01,770
I will stand up for you.

393
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,176
You bold demoness!

394
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:04,490
Don't bully Little Uncle!

395
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,250
I want to protect my senior.

396
00:23:10,270 --> 00:23:11,270
Little Uncle.

397
00:23:16,110 --> 00:23:18,090
Senior, where are you?

398
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:25,420
I will definitely avenge you.

399
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:33,980
They didn't catch me.

400
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:53,490
Don't kill me.

401
00:24:11,070 --> 00:24:12,070
Mentor.

402
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,680
Mentor.

403
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:18,176
Once I break the formation and get my power back,

404
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,220
we'll be safe again.

405
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:21,766
Mentor, please hold on.

406
00:24:21,790 --> 00:24:23,180
I've found a way to break it.

407
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:25,110
But it'll take an incense stick's time.

408
00:24:51,510 --> 00:24:52,510
Chaos Bell.

409
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:53,640
What bell?

410
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:56,240
You're not Changgeng.

411
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:58,440
Who are you?

412
00:24:59,830 --> 00:25:01,420
I have to give my name before I die?

413
00:25:02,830 --> 00:25:04,420
I am Lan Ling'e of Jade Division.

414
00:25:05,030 --> 00:25:06,180
Lan Ling'e?

415
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:08,480
No.

416
00:25:09,550 --> 00:25:10,660
You are not human.

417
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:12,920
I am not human.

418
00:25:13,590 --> 00:25:15,250
Right, you're not human.

419
00:25:17,270 --> 00:25:17,766
Then...

420
00:25:17,790 --> 00:25:19,140
We've searched for you for years.

421
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,200
So, you've been here all along.

422
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:23,620
Looking for me?

423
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:27,420
You don't know your origins?

424
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:28,420
I...

425
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:29,920
What origins?

426
00:25:30,030 --> 00:25:31,380
I have the Pregenesis Sword

427
00:25:32,110 --> 00:25:33,620
- you want.
- Changgeng.

428
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:41,006
Leave, quickly.

429
00:25:41,030 --> 00:25:42,060
Don't let them catch you.

430
00:25:43,030 --> 00:25:44,180
Thank you so much.

431
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:48,180
Kill Changgeng! Seize the Sword!

432
00:25:48,310 --> 00:25:49,930
My origins?

433
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,620
What poor quality!

434
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:56,006
Jerk!

435
00:25:56,030 --> 00:25:57,180
If not for my sister,

436
00:25:57,270 --> 00:25:59,150
5,000 spirit stones would surely not be enough.

437
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:01,920
Come at me!

438
00:26:14,830 --> 00:26:15,830
Coward!

439
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:16,960
Come at me!

440
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:20,290
Coward! Such a coward!

441
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:25,680
They're all here?

442
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:27,480
No.

443
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:28,920
Help!

444
00:26:32,270 --> 00:26:33,270
It's a trap!

445
00:26:39,310 --> 00:26:40,376
You...

446
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:43,730
You can break the Westdawn secret art?

447
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:03,220
Li Changshou.

448
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,860
Or perhaps.

449
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:08,730
I should call you Changgeng.

450
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,936
Everyone, count heads, quickly!

451
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:11,456
Over here, over here!

452
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:14,176
Injured, to the Hall of Mortal Coils!

453
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:14,456
Aunt.

454
00:27:14,480 --> 00:27:15,326
Ling'e.

455
00:27:15,350 --> 00:27:15,936
Aunt.

456
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:16,086
Junior.

457
00:27:16,110 --> 00:27:16,770
Are you alright?

458
00:27:16,830 --> 00:27:17,940
I'm fine, I'm fine.

459
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:19,136
Where is Senior Changshou?

460
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,220
I can't find him.

461
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:21,250
Where's Changshou?

462
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:22,656
Senior Changshou is back at Jade Division.

463
00:27:22,680 --> 00:27:23,800
He's breaking the formation.

464
00:27:24,070 --> 00:27:25,070
That fool.

465
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:26,176
Off on his own at a time like this?

466
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:26,856
Where are you heading?

467
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:28,046
To find Changshou and help him.

468
00:27:28,070 --> 00:27:29,070
You're not going.

469
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:29,766
Why?

470
00:27:29,790 --> 00:27:30,806
Because you're too restless.

471
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:31,856
Because you can't stay calm.

472
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,250
Because I'm worried about you!

473
00:27:38,790 --> 00:27:40,460
Didn't I tell you before?

474
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,856
I have an agreement with Qi Yuan.

475
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:42,456
I promised him

476
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:44,376
to look after Jade disciples.

477
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:44,660
I...

478
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,660
A promise must be kept.

479
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,010
This is my duty.

480
00:27:48,750 --> 00:27:49,250
I'll go.

481
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:50,720
Bye.

482
00:27:51,510 --> 00:27:52,590
Senior, I will go with you.

483
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,460
Stay here.

484
00:27:54,550 --> 00:27:55,416
Why on earth

485
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:56,526
won't you let me go with you?

486
00:27:56,550 --> 00:27:57,456
You tell me.

487
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,726
Why did I punish you on behalf of Mentor?

488
00:27:58,750 --> 00:27:59,750
Have you forgotten?

489
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:08,220
Jiu, stay here.

490
00:28:09,030 --> 00:28:10,140
Protect Mentor.

491
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:12,320
Protect the Hall of Mortal Coils.

492
00:28:13,270 --> 00:28:14,380
That is your duty.

493
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,420
Do you hear me?

494
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:25,440
Listen to me.

495
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:27,766
This time, do not let Mentor or me

496
00:28:27,790 --> 00:28:28,790
be disappointed in you.

497
00:28:36,830 --> 00:28:37,696
Take care, Senior.

498
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:38,810
Stay safe on the road.

499
00:28:39,270 --> 00:28:40,286
That's more like it.

500
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:41,310
I'm off.

501
00:28:42,590 --> 00:28:43,590
But...

502
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:44,900
The key to this crisis

503
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:47,250
is this formation that drains power.

504
00:28:47,830 --> 00:28:48,726
As long as power returns,

505
00:28:48,750 --> 00:28:50,090
the danger will pass.

506
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:52,330
Then what should we do?

507
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:53,400
There are two ways.

508
00:28:53,830 --> 00:28:55,726
First, break the formation.

509
00:28:55,750 --> 00:28:56,220
Second,

510
00:28:56,590 --> 00:28:58,980
get rid of the magic instrument driving this formation.

511
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:00,880
Remember this:

512
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:03,050
Once safe, find Jiu Jiu

513
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:04,086
and have her come to me.

514
00:29:04,110 --> 00:29:05,086
Aunt Jiu Jiu?

515
00:29:05,110 --> 00:29:05,896
That's right.

516
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:07,620
She's our sect's top swords woman.

517
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:09,140
When magical power is gone,

518
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,660
she's the strongest fighter.

519
00:29:11,270 --> 00:29:12,420
And easiest to fool.

520
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,460
Why say it so bluntly?

521
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:17,770
I suppose Uncle Jiu Wu is okay?

522
00:29:18,750 --> 00:29:19,900
Sorry, Senior.

523
00:29:25,070 --> 00:29:26,070
It's over.

524
00:29:27,440 --> 00:29:28,440
I botched it.

525
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:42,730
Changgeng,

526
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:44,290
keep running.

527
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:48,010
We finally meet.

528
00:29:52,590 --> 00:29:53,590
What?

529
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:57,050
Have we not met before?

530
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:59,460
I've long heard of your name.

531
00:30:00,480 --> 00:30:01,480
Meeting you

532
00:30:02,270 --> 00:30:03,460
is a first for me.

533
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:09,010
That's good then.

534
00:30:13,790 --> 00:30:15,700
You went through trouble to find me.

535
00:30:18,790 --> 00:30:19,900
Of course.

536
00:30:20,750 --> 00:30:22,090
Because only then

537
00:30:22,440 --> 00:30:24,660
can I kill you.

538
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:30,660
But more importantly,

539
00:30:31,070 --> 00:30:31,856
it's to let Seizing Sect take the blame

540
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:34,530
for Ascendance Sect's massacre,

541
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:37,620
and trigger war among the Three Sects

542
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:40,250
to turn you against each other.

543
00:30:42,880 --> 00:30:43,880
It's you.

544
00:30:46,510 --> 00:30:47,860
You made the Seizing Sect

545
00:30:49,640 --> 00:30:50,940
shoulder this infamy.

546
00:30:51,590 --> 00:30:53,050
All these years,

547
00:30:53,270 --> 00:30:55,490
you've been West dawn's mole

548
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:57,086
in Ascendance.

549
00:30:57,110 --> 00:30:58,110
Wrong.

550
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:00,766
Westdawn didn't make me a mole.

551
00:31:00,790 --> 00:31:04,250
I used Westdawn to strengthen Ascendance.

552
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,900
Strengthen Ascendance?

553
00:31:08,070 --> 00:31:09,726
Westdawn attacked us,

554
00:31:09,750 --> 00:31:11,456
killed many of our disciples,

555
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:13,006
and took my mentor as the formation core.

556
00:31:13,030 --> 00:31:14,980
That's strengthening Ascendance?

557
00:31:17,510 --> 00:31:19,460
Without destruction, no creation.

558
00:31:20,200 --> 00:31:22,660
Ascendance under Detached Master

559
00:31:23,350 --> 00:31:25,250
is hopeless.

560
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:26,856
Only I

561
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:28,936
can lead Ascendance

562
00:31:28,960 --> 00:31:31,380
and dominate the Three Realms.

563
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:38,570
You're truly hopeless.

564
00:31:39,830 --> 00:31:40,976
So,

565
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:42,856
you killed Seizing cultivators

566
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:44,460
and tarnished the sect's name

567
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:47,460
just to make them

568
00:31:48,680 --> 00:31:49,860
your scapegoats.

569
00:31:49,960 --> 00:31:51,456
Anyway, the Seizing Sect's reputation

570
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:53,250
is already rotten.

571
00:31:55,070 --> 00:31:56,250
A little more won't matter.

572
00:31:56,830 --> 00:31:57,830
Right.

573
00:31:58,750 --> 00:31:59,750
The Seizing Sect

574
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:01,860
is despised by all.

575
00:32:04,030 --> 00:32:05,616
This ragtag bunch

576
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:07,460
consists of misfits and mongrels.

577
00:32:07,550 --> 00:32:09,046
They're heartless.

578
00:32:09,070 --> 00:32:10,420
I'm sick of them.

579
00:32:17,350 --> 00:32:19,490
But they're living beings, aren't they?

580
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:22,180
They must have feelings.

581
00:32:25,510 --> 00:32:27,050
Then, do you think

582
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:30,860
they'd grieve over a fellow's death?

583
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,810
What is that to me?

584
00:32:35,140 --> 00:32:36,047
[Steady]

585
00:32:36,071 --> 00:32:37,420
I'll ask you one last time.

586
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:39,176
Did you lead the Demon Clan here,

587
00:32:39,200 --> 00:32:40,976
use demonic arts on my mentor,

588
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:42,726
and set up

589
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,766
this power-draining formation?

590
00:32:43,790 --> 00:32:45,250
Not only that.

591
00:32:47,350 --> 00:32:49,010
I also ruined Qi Yuan's foundation,

592
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:51,566
used Gnatsting Needle

593
00:32:51,590 --> 00:32:54,246
on our fellows,

594
00:32:54,270 --> 00:32:54,976
used Westdawn Sect

595
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:57,530
for my Aureate Immortal Tribulation,

596
00:32:57,750 --> 00:32:58,750
and expelled all elders

597
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:02,050
who opposed me.

598
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,250
Elder Kuai.

599
00:33:06,480 --> 00:33:07,480
It was you?

600
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:10,460
Why isn't it Jiu Jiu?

601
00:33:15,030 --> 00:33:16,030
Junior.

602
00:33:16,270 --> 00:33:17,270
Junior.

603
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,006
If it were Jiu Jiu,

604
00:33:20,030 --> 00:33:22,050
her sword could've held an incense stick's time.

605
00:33:22,480 --> 00:33:23,660
But Uncle Jiu Wu...

606
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:27,530
You're buying time.

607
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:29,110
Elder Kuai,

608
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:31,200
I never expected

609
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:33,730
you were behind this plot.

610
00:33:34,200 --> 00:33:36,006
Uncle, buy me some time.

611
00:33:36,030 --> 00:33:37,050
I'll save Mentor first.

612
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,480
Jiu Wu,

613
00:33:44,070 --> 00:33:46,250
though you're Detached Master's disciple,

614
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:50,050
you've run the sect for years.

615
00:33:50,480 --> 00:33:51,660
I know

616
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:54,180
you're slick and worldly.

617
00:33:57,070 --> 00:33:59,090
Everyone likes you.

618
00:33:59,750 --> 00:34:02,010
All are willing to heed you.

619
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,000
You're

620
00:34:05,270 --> 00:34:06,460
a real talent.

621
00:34:07,350 --> 00:34:09,090
If you'd follow me,

622
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:10,820
from now on,

623
00:34:11,630 --> 00:34:13,170
my trust in you

624
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:19,380
will far surpass that of Detached Master.

625
00:34:23,110 --> 00:34:24,490
Are you willing?

626
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:35,030
It's too late.

627
00:34:37,190 --> 00:34:38,740
Why do they keep multiplying?

628
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:48,960
Our sect

629
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:50,650
has no traitor like you!

630
00:35:05,110 --> 00:35:06,490
What a pity.

631
00:35:13,030 --> 00:35:14,030
Uncle!

632
00:35:20,360 --> 00:35:22,610
I am an Aureate Immortal.

633
00:35:23,190 --> 00:35:26,856
A mere sword cannot harm me.

634
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,650
Changshou, back to the Hall of Mortal Coils!

635
00:35:29,030 --> 00:35:30,030
Uncle, you mustn't!

636
00:35:30,070 --> 00:35:31,570
Now, we're all low on magic arts.

637
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:33,010
He's not that much stronger.

638
00:35:33,110 --> 00:35:34,110
Is that so?

639
00:35:35,070 --> 00:35:37,800
♪ Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam ♪

640
00:35:38,140 --> 00:35:40,260
♪ Now, a levee holds back the storm ♪

641
00:35:40,570 --> 00:35:43,676
♪ Fight against fate for my life ♪

642
00:35:43,700 --> 00:35:46,550
♪ Close eyes to sense the world ♪

643
00:35:47,550 --> 00:35:48,550
Uncle.

644
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:50,166
He's using demonic arts now.

645
00:35:50,190 --> 00:35:51,190
We can't beat him.

646
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:52,170
I'll take you away.

647
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:53,280
Changshou, listen to me.

648
00:35:53,670 --> 00:35:55,050
I promised your mentor.

649
00:35:55,280 --> 00:35:56,570
I must see it through.

650
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:57,627
Go!

651
00:35:57,651 --> 00:36:03,440
♪ Though millions block, it echoes loud ♪

652
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:06,800
Uncle, wait for me.

653
00:36:09,020 --> 00:36:09,636
♪ Plain and unremarkable ♪

654
00:36:09,660 --> 00:36:10,597
♪ From the start, plan for storms ♪

655
00:36:10,621 --> 00:36:12,046
♪ Seek refuge, survive, hide my skill ♪

656
00:36:12,070 --> 00:36:13,530
Two ways to break this formation:

657
00:36:14,030 --> 00:36:15,300
Either break the formation,

658
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:18,340
or discard the artifact that powers it.

659
00:36:18,720 --> 00:36:19,946
♪ The evil knows no shame ♪

660
00:36:19,970 --> 00:36:21,286
♪ Immortal trials burn cowardice away ♪

661
00:36:21,310 --> 00:36:22,496
♪ The howling wind calls to me ♪

662
00:36:22,520 --> 00:36:23,876
♪ Gouging eyes to light the night and ferry souls ♪

663
00:36:23,900 --> 00:36:25,460
♪ My soul is standing like a mountain ♪

664
00:36:25,560 --> 00:36:27,120
♪ Arrows in flesh as the string ♪

665
00:36:27,230 --> 00:36:28,756
Your Highness.

666
00:36:28,780 --> 00:36:30,726
♪ Standing tall, heart hides its might ♪

667
00:36:30,750 --> 00:36:32,966
♪ Today my name reaches heaven ♪

668
00:36:32,990 --> 00:36:33,897
♪ Actually, I've descended to the world ♪

669
00:36:33,921 --> 00:36:35,380
The golden dragon is your true form.

670
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:37,320
Once your transformation succeeds,

671
00:36:37,440 --> 00:36:39,300
the Pregenesis Sword won't take effect on you.

672
00:36:41,550 --> 00:36:42,780
I know you wish to save them.

673
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:44,260
But you don't know how, right?

674
00:36:45,070 --> 00:36:46,170
I wish to save them too.

675
00:36:46,630 --> 00:36:47,820
But you must help me.

676
00:36:47,860 --> 00:36:48,986
♪ Charging against the wind ♪

677
00:36:49,010 --> 00:36:50,406
♪ Old scars reveal the truth ♪

678
00:36:50,430 --> 00:36:51,217
♪ Even if all brave men fall ♪

679
00:36:51,241 --> 00:36:52,466
♪ Chugging the murky wine ♪

680
00:36:52,490 --> 00:36:54,870
♪ Close eyes to sense the world ♪

681
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:58,530
We've been in the same sect for years.

682
00:36:59,230 --> 00:37:02,050
I really can't bear to kill you.

683
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:04,650
Knowing you'll lose,

684
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:08,420
why court your destruction?

685
00:37:11,460 --> 00:37:15,136
♪ From primal chaos ♪

686
00:37:15,160 --> 00:37:19,496
♪ To the starry sky ♪

687
00:37:19,520 --> 00:37:23,076
♪ In the whole world ♪

688
00:37:23,100 --> 00:37:24,166
♪ We shall hold the balance ♪

689
00:37:24,190 --> 00:37:25,610
Junior Qi Yuan,

690
00:37:26,030 --> 00:37:27,130
this time,

691
00:37:27,590 --> 00:37:29,690
you've landed me in deep trouble.

692
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:34,780
Traitor, face death!

693
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:45,916
♪ The cauldron tempers divine blades ♪

694
00:37:45,940 --> 00:37:49,900
♪ The furnace refines the empty void ♪

695
00:37:51,720 --> 00:37:53,870
♪ The Way is in mystic fate ♪

696
00:37:56,320 --> 00:37:57,086
Get away.

697
00:37:57,110 --> 00:37:58,110
Get away.

698
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:14,650
Thank you for your help.

699
00:38:15,110 --> 00:38:17,260
May I ask your name?

700
00:38:17,510 --> 00:38:19,310
I'm a nameless disciple from Ascendance Sect.

701
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:22,646
You came on a dragon.

702
00:38:22,670 --> 00:38:24,690
How could you be a nameless disciple?

703
00:38:27,110 --> 00:38:28,420
You are Changgeng?

704
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:31,820
Changgeng sent me.

705
00:38:32,630 --> 00:38:33,530
He sent you?

706
00:38:33,630 --> 00:38:35,260
Changgeng has a plan to win.

707
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,166
Please come with me.

708
00:38:36,190 --> 00:38:37,190
I am not going.

709
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,486
I have not said where yet.

710
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:39,416
I am not going anywhere.

711
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:41,416
It's Seizing vs Human. What's it to me?

712
00:38:41,440 --> 00:38:42,256
You're truly not going?

713
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:43,280
Absolutely not.

714
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:44,456
Will you go or not?

715
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:45,170
What are you doing?

716
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:47,606
Quick! Pull me up!

717
00:38:47,630 --> 00:38:48,820
Pull me up!

718
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,126
I am warning you.

719
00:38:50,150 --> 00:38:51,260
Will you go or not?

720
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:52,980
How dare you threaten me?

721
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,320
Will you go or not?

722
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:55,526
How dare you threaten me?

723
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:56,570
This is no threat.

724
00:38:56,920 --> 00:38:58,980
It's a request to forces against this crisis.

725
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,280
Joining forces?

726
00:39:00,710 --> 00:39:02,170
What jest is this?

727
00:39:03,030 --> 00:39:04,030
See for yourself.

728
00:39:04,150 --> 00:39:05,460
Those Seizing disciples below

729
00:39:05,670 --> 00:39:07,300
are all bound by demonic arts.

730
00:39:07,670 --> 00:39:08,486
With your Aureate Immortal power,

731
00:39:08,510 --> 00:39:09,610
can't you even see that?

732
00:39:09,840 --> 00:39:11,046
Of course, I can see it.

733
00:39:11,070 --> 00:39:12,380
Today, it's Seizing vs Human.

734
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:13,760
How about tomorrow?

735
00:39:14,070 --> 00:39:15,460
Elucidating vs Seizing?

736
00:39:15,630 --> 00:39:16,940
Human vs Elucidating?

737
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:18,530
If this keeps going,

738
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:21,420
is that your mentor's Way?

739
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:22,920
You...

740
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:23,490
You...

741
00:39:23,590 --> 00:39:24,860
A force has now arisen.

742
00:39:25,280 --> 00:39:26,720
They're the Three Sects' common foe.

743
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:29,260
They want the Three Sects to fight each other.

744
00:39:29,550 --> 00:39:31,690
Must you regret standing idly by

745
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:33,896
after the enemy bares its fangs?

746
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:34,920
And Changgeng...

747
00:39:35,070 --> 00:39:36,820
What does Changgeng really want?

748
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:43,980
He wants to learn to trust.

749
00:40:33,450 --> 00:40:39,230
♪ See mortal joys and sorrows ♪

750
00:40:39,900 --> 00:40:46,600
♪ Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds ♪

751
00:40:48,130 --> 00:40:54,180
♪ Alas, love has many twists and turns ♪

752
00:40:54,810 --> 00:41:01,260
♪ Memories filled with sorrow ♪

753
00:41:02,000 --> 00:41:09,120
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

754
00:41:09,500 --> 00:41:16,400
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

755
00:41:16,780 --> 00:41:24,106
♪ Tearfully, this life's bond is not over ♪

756
00:41:24,130 --> 00:41:31,300
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪

757
00:41:47,440 --> 00:41:52,610
♪ Down a few more cups of wine ♪

758
00:41:53,700 --> 00:42:00,720
♪ Through land and sea, I ask you to come ♪

759
00:42:01,910 --> 00:42:07,850
♪ For honor's sake, upright and grand ♪

760
00:42:08,550 --> 00:42:15,630
♪ Alas, our story is short ♪

761
00:42:15,970 --> 00:42:23,080
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

762
00:42:23,400 --> 00:42:29,880
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

763
00:42:30,660 --> 00:42:37,870
♪ Tears fall, this fate's not done ♪

764
00:42:38,260 --> 00:42:46,080
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪
